<p>
        <code class="classname">Zend_Application_Resource_ResourceAbstract</code> es una clase
        abstracta que implementa <a class="link" href="zend.application.core-functionality.phtml#zend.application.core-functionality.resource-resource" title="14.5.6. Zend_Application_Resource_Resource">Zend_Application_Resource_Resource</a>,
